{"id":11471,"date":"2024-08-24T11:33:25","date_gmt":"2024-08-24T11:33:25","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/?p=11471"},"modified":"2026-08-07T08:09:43","modified_gmt":"2026-08-07T08:09:43","slug":"what-does-data-analyst-do","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/what-does-data-analyst-do\/","title":{"rendered":"What Does a Data Analyst Do? 2026 Guide"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p>In 2026, data analysts remain vital in transforming raw data into strategic insights that drive business decisions. What does a data analyst do? They collect, process, and perform statistical analyses to make sense of large datasets. Their work involves a blend of technical skills and business acumen as they turn complex figures into understandable insights that help shape company strategies.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Data analysts&#8217; responsibilities include data cleaning, data visualisation, and predictive modelling. They enable companies across various industries, such as finance, healthcare, and technology, to optimise their operations. By understanding patterns and trends within data, data analysts provide valuable contributions that influence tactical and strategic business decisions.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>This essential role demands solid analytical skills and the ability to transform complex data into meaningful and clear information.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Also Read:<\/strong> <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/data-analyst-skills\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Top 8 In-Demand Data Analyst Skills<\/a><\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Who Is a Data Analyst?<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>A data analyst specialises in collecting, processing, and analysing data to enable businesses to make informed decisions. The core responsibilities of a data analyst include interpreting data using statistical tools, creating reports, and developing data-driven insights to solve business problems.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>They work across various finance, healthcare, and technology industries, providing valuable insights that influence strategic planning and operational improvements. Data analysts are proficient in various <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/best-programming-languages\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">programming languages<\/a> like <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/resources\/sql\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">SQL<\/a> and <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/resources\/python\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Python<\/a> and use visualisation tools like Tableau to present their findings easily.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>The work of a data analyst revolves around turning raw data into actionable information, supporting organisations to enhance efficiency, understanding market trends, and improving overall performance. This role is crucial in leveraging data to drive success and innovation within a company.<\/p>\n\n\n\n    <!-- LOTTIE SCRIPT -->\n    <script src=\"https:\/\/unpkg.com\/@lottiefiles\/lottie-player@latest\/dist\/lottie-player.js\"><\/script>\n\n    <section class=\"wscube-courses mb-2\">\n        <div class=\"container\">\n            <h3 class=\"mb-4\">Recommended Professional <\/br> Certificates<\/h3>\n\n            <div class=\"owl-carousel courseOwl\">\n\n                \n                    \n                    <div class=\"course-card card-r rounded-4\">\n\n                        <!-- \u2705 SINGLE MEDIA DIV (FIXED) -->\n                        <div class=\"course-media\"\n                             data-lottie=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/uploads\/images\/courses\/json-images\/data-analyst.json\"\n                             data-fallback=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/themes\/newwscube\/assets\/imges\/Image.png\">\n                        <\/div>\n\n                        <div class=\"card-body\">\n                            <h5>Data Analytics Course with Gen AI<\/h5>\n\n      